em_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "10", "stem": "10. 计算：(a-b)²-(b-a)²=____。", "student_answer": "(a-b)²-(a-b)²=0", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "11", "stem": "11. 多项式 5x² - 2kxy - 6x²y + 1 不含 x²y 项，则 k=____。", "student_answer": "3", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "12", "stem": "12. 若 10^m=3，10^n=2，那么 10^(2m-n)=____。", "student_answer": "72", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "13", "stem": "13. 计算：(-1/2)² × 8 = ____。", "student_answer": "1", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "14", "stem": "14. 已知 x-y=3，xy=2，则 x²+y² 的值为____。", "student_answer": "13", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number