)² - (x+2y)(x-2y) - 2y²\n= x² - 4xy + 4y² - (x² - 4y²) - 2y²\n= x² - 4xy + 4y² - x² + 4y² - 2y²\n= -4xy + 6y²", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "20", "stem": "20. 计算：(x+2y-3)(x-2y+3)", "student_answer": "解：原式 = (x+2y-3)(x-2y+3)\n= [x+(2y-3)][x-(2y-3)]\n= x² - (2y-3)²\n= x² - (4y² - 12y + 9)\n= x² - 4y² + 12y - 9", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "21", "stem": "21. 计算：(x+y-2z)²", "student_answer": "解：原式 = (x+y-2z)²\n= (x+y)² - 2(x+y)(2z) + (2z)²\n= x² + 2xy + y² - 4xz - 4yz + 4z²", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "22", "stem": "22. 利用公式计算：1001×999-99²", "student_answer": "解：原式 = (1000+1)(1000-1) - 99²\n= 1000² - 1 - 99²\n= 1000000 - 1 - 9801\n= 990198", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "23", "stem": "23. 计算：(2/3 ab²)² · 1/2 a²b·(-8ab³)", "student_answer": "解：原式 = (2/3 ab²)² · 1/2 a²b·(-8ab³)\n= 4/9 a²b⁴ · 1/2 a²b·(-8ab³)\n= -16/9 a⁵b⁸", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "24", "stem": "24. 计算：(ab+3b)(a²b-3ab+6)", "student_answer": "解：原式 = (2ab)(2ab) - (3ab) + (2b)(2ab) - (3ab) + (2b)6\n= 2a²b² - 3ab + 4ab² - 6ab + 12b\n= 2a²b² + 4ab² - 9ab + 12b", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "25(1)", "stem": "25. 已知 x-y=2，x²+y²=6，(1) 求代数式 xy 的值；", "student_answer": "解：∵ x-y=2，x²+y²=6\n∴ (x-y)² = x² - 2xy + y² = 4\n∴ 2xy = 2\n∴ xy = 1", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "25(2)", "stem": "25. 已知 x-y=2，x²+y²=6，(2) 求代数式 x³y - xy³ 的值。", "student_answer": "解：原式 = xy(x²-y²) = xy(x-y)(x+y)\n∵ (x-y)² = x² - 2xy + y² = 4\n∴ xy = 1\n∴ x+y = ±2√2\n∴ 原式 = 1×2×2√2 = ±4√2", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "26", "stem": "26. 阅读材料：求 1+2+2²+2³+...+2⁹⁹+2¹⁰⁰ 的值。", "student_answer": "解：设 S = 1+2+2²+2³+...+2⁹⁹+2¹⁰⁰\n则 2S = 2+2²+2³+...+2¹⁰⁰+2¹⁰¹\n∴ 2S - S = 2¹⁰¹ - 1\n即 S = 2¹⁰¹ - 1\n∴ 1+2+2²+...+2¹⁰⁰ = 2¹⁰¹ - 1", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "27", "stem": "27. 已知 a+b=6，ab=3，求 a⁴+b⁴ 的值。", "student_answer": "解：∵ a+b=6，ab=3\n∴ a²+b² = (a+b)² - 2ab = 36 - 6 = 30\n∴ a⁴+b⁴ = (a²+b²)² - 2a²b² = 900 - 18 = 882", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}, {"no": "28", "stem": "28. 已知 (x²+2x+3)(x²+2x-1)=5，求 x²+2x 的值。", "student_answer": "解：设 x²+2x = y\n(y+3)(y-1)=5\ny²+2y-3=5\ny²+2y-8=0\n(y+4)(y-2)=0\ny+4=0 或 y-2=0\ny₁=-4，y₂=2\n∴ x²+2x = -4 或 2", "page": "1", "handwriting_uncertain": false, "uncertain_note": "", "stem_uncertain": false, "stem_note": "", "number_uncertain": true, "number_note": "思考过程兜底：思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）", "reasoning_uncertain": true, "number_verified": false, "attribution_note": "", "figure": ""}], "zoom_note": "题号复核未完成（所有模型都失败了: glmf: 输出被截断（finish_reason=length）），已保留首轮转写；思考过程暴露题号不确定（思考过程现题号不确定表述（…，stem_uncertain false？ 我觉得可以。但如果 D 不确定，可以在 stem_no…）），29 题标存疑；配图识别完成：1 道几何大题中 1 道写出配图描述。"}
